<div class="page-header"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets in California</h1><p>From the Bay Area to Los Angeles, Orange County, and San Diego, California homeowners and designers can spec the full Pinnacle Sales lineup — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — through independent local showrooms.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<p>California is several markets in one. Northern California leans clean and contemporary; Southern California spans transitional coastal to sleek modern; and the high-end coastal and hillside enclaves drive demand for European handleless kitchens. This guide covers what's available statewide and where to see it.</p>
<h2 id="find-a-kitchen-cabinet-showroom-near-you">Find a Kitchen Cabinet Showroom Near You</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales brands are sold through independent local showrooms across California. Tell us your project and where you're located, and we'll connect you with the nearest authorized dealer.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Find a Local Dealer</a></p>
<h2 id="premium-cabinetry-brands-available-in-california">Premium Cabinetry Brands Available in California</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint, inset, and wide wood species for California's transitional and coastal kitchens.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access modern construction — a strong fit for contemporary Bay Area and LA remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for builder and ADU projects across the state.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Premium handleless European kitchens for high-end coastal and hillside homes.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="california-kitchen-design-trends">California Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Northern California favors clean, contemporary kitchens — frameless construction, flat-panel and slab fronts, warm woods against white and gray. Southern California ranges from breezy transitional in the coastal communities to crisp modern in the hills, with two-tone schemes and walnut or white-oak islands. Across the premium coastal and hillside markets — Marin, the Peninsula, the Westside, Newport Coast — handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and frameless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse</a> kitchens continue to gain share.</p>
